    "is_artifact_or_model_limitation": "Both. (1) Evaluation artifact: the empathy detection module requires explicit emotional language markers, but medical LLM completions tend to be factual/clinical without emotional phrasing. (2) Model limitation: LLM completions in HealthBench are optimized for medical accuracy, not bedside manner. Zero-empathy cases have slightly MORE n_turns (2.73 vs 2.45, p<1e-4), suggesting longer clinical discussions that are thorough but impersonal. The empathy dimension is essentially orthogonal to clinical quality in this dataset."
